  "details": "Currently mobile clients should be able to show very poor avatars up to 4 by changing Avatar Display Setting (a.k.a. \"show avatar\"). However clients can't show them by the usual operation. It's an inconsistent way with Quest.\n\n# Reproduction steps:\n\n1. Join to an instance.\n\n2. Select a player who is using a very poor avatar (imposter).\n\n3. Change Avatar Display Setting to show the avatar, but it's reverted to the default. <- Issue\n\n- You can show the avatar by using double-tap in the step 3.\n\n- Once avatar display settings has been successfully changed, you can properly change the setting with single tap until you leave the instance.\n\n# Environments:\n\n- Android: 2025.3.2 (Build 1695)\n\n- iOS: 2025.3.1 (Build 1681)\n\n# Japanese summary:\n\nスマホ版でVery PoorのアバターをShow Avatarしようとしても設定を戻されてしまい表示できない不具合。\n\n設定変更のボタンをシングルタップでなくダブルタップすると表示でき、インスタンスを抜けるまでは正しく設定変更することができる。",
